{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":12,"count":26,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L05-1-03\",\"哪里\",\"哪裡/哪兒\",\"哪里/哪儿\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我的錢包在哪裡？","pinyin":"Wǒ de qiánbāo zài nǎlǐ?","english":"Where is my wallet?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-03","sourceFront":"哪裡/哪兒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"好啊！你想去哪裡？","pinyin":"Hǎo a! Nǐ xiǎng qù nǎlǐ?","english":"Sounds great! Where do you want to go?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"妳知道去哪裡買這個牌子的衣服嗎？","pinyin":"Nǐ zhīdào qù nǎlǐ mǎi zhè ge páizi de yīfu ma?","english":"Do you know where you can get this clothing brand?","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你覺得哪裡不舒服？","pinyin":"Nǐ juéde nǎlǐ bù shūfu?","english":"Where are you uncomfortable? (What brings you here today?)","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-02\",\"網球\",\"網球\",\"网球\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我跟同學常常一起在學校打網球。","pinyin":"Wǒ gēn tóngxué chángcháng yìqǐ zài xuéxiào dǎ wǎngqiú.","english":"My classmates and I often play tennis together at the school.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-03","sourceFront":"球","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"打網球怎麼樣？中明說妳的網球打得很好，我們一起去打吧。","pinyin":"Dǎ wǎngqiú zěnmeyàng? Zhōngmíng shuō nǐ de wǎngqiú dǎ de hěn hǎo, wǒmen yìqǐ qù dǎ ba.","english":"How about playing tennis? Zhongming said you play it well. Let’s go play it together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我的興趣是運動，打網球、游泳，我都喜歡。","pinyin":"Wǒ de xìngqù shì yùndòng, dǎ wǎngqiú, yóuyǒng, wǒ dōu xǐhuān.","english":"My hobby is doing exercise. I like both tennis and swimming.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-01","sourceFront":"興趣","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3}],"wordHook":"網(net) + 球(ball) → a ball game over a net: tennis."},{"key":"[\"B1L06-3-12\",\"有的时候\",\"有（的）時候\",\"有（的）时候\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個學期開始，從星期一到星期五我都有華語課，每天從上午八點四十分到中午十二點上課，下午一點寫功課，有時候也跟同學練習說中文。","pinyin":"Zhè ge xuéqí kāishǐ, cóng xīngqí yī dào xīngqí wǔ, wǒ dōu yǒu Huáyǔ kè, měi tiān cóng shàngwǔ bā diǎn sìshí fēn dào zhōngwǔ shí’èr diǎn shàngkè, xiàwǔ yī diǎn xiě gōngkè, yǒushíhou yě gēn tóngxué liànxí shuō Zhōngwén.","english":"This semester I have Chinese class from 8:40 a.m. to 12:00 noon, Mondays to Fridays. I start to do my homework at 1:00 p.m., and sometimes I practice speaking Chinese with my classmates.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L01-2-08\",\"心\",\"心\",\"心\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他唱歌唱得很開心。","pinyin":"Tā chànggē chàng de hěn kāixīn.","english":"He enjoys singing very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-05","sourceFront":"唱歌","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"今天我去朋友家玩得很開心。","pinyin":"Jīntiān wǒ qù péngyǒu jiā wán de hěn kāixīn.","english":"I had fun at my friend’s place today.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-14","sourceFront":"得","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他今天很開心。","pinyin":"Tā jīntiān hěn kāixīn.","english":"He is very happy today.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-3-08","sourceFront":"開心","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"甜的點心叫甜點。","pinyin":"Tián de diǎnxīn jiào tiándiǎn.","english":"Sweet snacks are called dessert.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-3-05","sourceFront":"點心","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我很擔心他，請他去看醫生，也告訴他要聽醫生的話，不要忘記多喝水、多休息。","pinyin":"Wǒ hěn dānxīn tā, qǐng tā qù kàn yīshēng, yě gàosu tā yào tīng yīshēng de huà, bú yào wàngjì duō hē shuǐ, duō xiūxí.","english":"I’m so worried about him, so I told him to go see a doctor. I also told him to listen to the doctor, to drink plenty of water and get some rest.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他說他會去看醫生，請我們不要擔心，如果他好了，就會來學校上課。","pinyin":"Tā shuō tā huì qù kàn yīshēng, qǐng wǒmen bú yào dānxīn, rúguǒ tā hǎo le, jiù huì lái xuéxiào shàngkè.","english":"He said he will go see a doctor and he does not want to worry us. If he feels better, he will come to school.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"很多年輕男生愛在書店看汽車雜誌，汽車很貴，他們不一定可以買新車，可是都看得很開心。","pinyin":"Hěn duō niánqīng nánshēng ài zài shūdiàn kàn qìchē zázhì, qìchē hěn guì, tāmen bù yídìng kěyǐ mǎi xīn chē, kěshì dōu kàn de hěn kāixīn.","english":"Many young men like to read car magazines at bookstores. Cars are expensive and they don’t usually have the money to buy new ones; however, they are very happy just by reading those magazines.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"A curved bowl with three drops inside pulses like a beating 心(heart)."},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-21\",\"铁\",\"鐵\",\"铁\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這條鐵路從北部一直到南部，一共三百公里。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-20","sourceFront":"鐵路","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"聽說高鐵很快，你搭過沒有？","pinyin":"Tīngshuō gāotiě hěn kuài, nǐ dā guo méiyǒu?","english":"I heard the high-speed rail is very fast; have you ever taken it?","sourceCardId":"B1L16-2-03","sourceFront":"搭","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"自從有了高速鐵路，不僅縮短了交通時間，人與人之間的距離也變近了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-22","sourceFront":"高速","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像機場、高鐵、捷運這類公共交通建設，都需要很多經費才能完成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-21","sourceFront":"建設","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣鐵路局的網站訂票，一人最多只能訂六張搭車當天的票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-28","sourceFront":"最多","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在已經沒有所謂的鐵飯碗了，有專業技術才有保障。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-19","sourceFront":"鐵飯碗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L13-2-05\",\"后\",\"後\",\"后\",\"Det\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"後天是我朋友的生日，我想送他一個大蛋糕。","pinyin":"Hòutiān shì wǒ péngyǒu de shēngrì, wǒ xiǎng sòng tā yí ge dà dàngāo.","english":"The day after tomorrow is my friend’s birthday; I want to give him a big cake.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-19","sourceFront":"後天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"弟弟在門後面。","pinyin":"Dìdi zài mén hòumiàn.","english":"My younger brother is behind the door.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-06","sourceFront":"門","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我旁邊有日本同學，前面跟後面都有美國同學。","pinyin":"Wǒ pángbiān yǒu Rìběn tóngxué, qiánmiàn gēn hòumiàn dōu yǒu Měiguó tóngxué.","english":"There are Japanese classmates beside me, and there are American classmates in front and behind.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-23","sourceFront":"後（面）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"後天去呢？","pinyin":"Hòutiān qù ne?","english":"How about the day after tomorrow then?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L05-2-11\",\"人們\",\"人們\",\"人们\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"夏天的夜晚，人們喜歡在屋子外面吹著風、喝著茶，聊聊有趣的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-12","sourceFront":"夜晚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"愛心服務社社員去安養院陪老人過年，讓老人們感覺相當溫暖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-30","sourceFront":"相當","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"便利的交通，不僅縮短了南北城市的距離，也節省了人們寶貴的時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-28","sourceFront":"縮短","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不少外國人說，臺灣最大的魅力是人們能夠接受不同的文化、語言和想法，所以在臺灣生活非常自在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-31","sourceFront":"魅力","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當人們生活水準提高，開始重視生活品質時，休閒活動也就跟著多了起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-31","sourceFront":"水準","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現代各式各樣的科技產品，讓人們的生活更舒適、便利","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-02","sourceFront":"現代","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店滿足了人們購物的需求，就是不出門，也可買到各式各樣的生活用品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-08","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到地震災區救災的軍人們，這幾天忙得連一頓飯都沒辦法好好地吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-04","sourceFront":"頓","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路是很偉大的發明，就算不出門，也能讓人們得到全球各地的訊息。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-20","sourceFront":"發明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從有了抽號機以後，人們就不需要站著排隊了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-13","sourceFront":"抽號機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以前人們常用磁帶來存電腦的重要資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-14","sourceFront":"磁帶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不論是工業或家庭廢水，對人們的健康都有不好的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-44","sourceFront":"廢水","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"生命就像海洋一樣，只有勇敢的人們才能抵達海的另一邊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-47","sourceFront":"海洋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"空氣越髒，人們的肺也就越不健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-50","sourceFront":"肺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有時候只要什麼都不想，好好睡一覺，就能讓人們紓壓。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-46","sourceFront":"紓壓","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"看見有困難的人們，有能力的話就得想辦法幫助他們，不應該不理他們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-53","sourceFront":"理","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我愛看漫畫，在漫畫裡可以看見許多人們還沒實現的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-05","sourceFront":"漫畫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"本地社區的房子常被好奇的觀光客破壞，令人們十分不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-09","sourceFront":"好奇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次座談會邀請了各領域的人們，主要目的是對國內的地方建設提一些建議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-38","sourceFront":"座談會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過血液檢查，人們就可以知道自己的血型。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-33","sourceFront":"血液","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人們為了節省勞力，發明了許多實用的機械。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-37","sourceFront":"勞力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隨著電子產業發展，人們的生活習慣也受到很深的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-06","sourceFront":"產業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"世界各地的神話雖然不見得都真實，卻能讓人們多少了解一些古代的風俗習慣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-01","sourceFront":"神話","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國古代的人們相信，當好人碰到危險或困難時，會有神仙到人間來幫助他們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-08","sourceFront":"神仙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 人(person) and 們(plural marker for pronouns and some nouns): 人們 means people."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-2-20\",\"戰爭\",\"戰爭\",\"战争\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"林伯伯透過網路、報紙，尋找三十年前因為戰爭而分開的家人，最後終於找到了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-31","sourceFront":"尋找","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"一小部分人引起的戰爭使人民付出了相當大的代價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-08","sourceFront":"代價","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"亞洲地區發生了戰爭，使人民生活上所受的的壓力相當大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-17","sourceFront":"受","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家博物館曾因戰爭而被破壞，如今總算重新開放參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-04","sourceFront":"如今","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"戰爭雖然勝利了，這個國家卻也失去了許多寶貴的生命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-23","sourceFront":"勝利","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他看了歷史電影後，就非常崇拜戰爭中的革命英雄。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-30","sourceFront":"英雄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那支軍隊受的是特殊訓練，只在發生重大戰爭時才派出。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-49","sourceFront":"支","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 戰(war) and 爭(dispute): 戰爭 means war."},{"key":"[\"B4L01-2-01\",\"隨著\",\"隨著\",\"随着\",\"Prep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"隨著科技越來越進步，手機的功能也越來越多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-01","sourceFront":"隨著","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"一個人的想法會隨著身分、角色的不同而改變。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-18","sourceFront":"身分","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個時代都有自己的價值標準，社會習俗及生活規矩也常隨著時代改變。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-15","sourceFront":"規矩","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我坐在公園裡看著花兒隨著風搖擺，那個樣子真是可愛極了。