:null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-43\",\"享受\",\"享受\",\"享受\",\"Vst/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"購物是一種享受，超過個人需求的消費，卻只會帶來煩惱。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-43","sourceFront":"享受","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在冬天，臺灣南部比北部暖和，你可以到南部享受暖暖的陽光。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-49","sourceFront":"暖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"在路邊的攤子享受小吃，得注意他們處理食物的方式衛不衛生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-28","sourceFront":"衛生","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"夏天一到，就有不少遊客到海灘，光著身體享受陽光與海風。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-56","sourceFront":"光","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了更有效地利用地球資源，我寧願減少不必要的生活享受。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-09","sourceFront":"寧願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果想入會員並享受我們健身房所提供的服務，請您到櫃臺辦理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-15","sourceFront":"入","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們工廠與那家旅行社有合作關係，廠內員工如果報名他們的旅行團，都可以享受優惠價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-14","sourceFront":"旅行社","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"登山的時候得注意安全，事前多準備，才能享受登山的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-37","sourceFront":"登山","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"夏天在海灘上踏著浪散步，是一件非常享受的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-16","sourceFront":"踏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"貓很享受抓癢，但要是你抓錯地方或方式不對，反而會使貓發脾氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-54","sourceFront":"抓癢","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在冬天的深夜裡，坐在溫暖的地毯上靜靜地看書是一種享受。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-14","sourceFront":"地毯","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"跟那位學者談話是種享受，能夠自由又自在地交換想法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-04","sourceFront":"學者","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們週末常去鄉下走走，享受農村生活，黃昏時才回市區。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-49","sourceFront":"黃昏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L06-1-39\",\"傷腦筋\",\"傷腦筋\",\"伤脑筋\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"所有令人傷腦筋的過程，都是為了使自己變成腦筋很好的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-40","sourceFront":"腦筋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"A:哎呀！我的手機掉到河裡了。 （shock or annoyance）B:那真是傷腦筋，看來你只好再買一支了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-41","sourceFront":"哎呀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-04\",\"開\",\"開\",\"开\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他唱歌唱得很開心。","pinyin":"Tā chànggē chàng de hěn kāixīn.","english":"He enjoys singing very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-05","sourceFront":"唱歌","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"今天我去朋友家玩得很開心。","pinyin":"Jīntiān wǒ qù péngyǒu jiā wán de hěn kāixīn.","english":"I had fun at my friend’s place today.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-14","sourceFront":"得","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他今天很開心。","pinyin":"Tā jīntiān hěn kāixīn.","english":"He is very happy today.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-3-08","sourceFront":"開心","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我記得有羊、馬、兔子……，最特別的是龍。（打開課本）妳看看……","pinyin":"Wǒ jìdé yǒu yáng, mǎ, tùzi..., zuì tèbié de shì lóng. (dǎkāi kèběn) Nǐ kànkan...","english":"I remember there are goats, horses, rabbits..., and the most special one is the dragon. (Open the textbook) You see...","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"最近感冒的人很多，我的同學國安也感冒了，今天開始發燒了。","pinyin":"Zuìjìn gǎnmào de rén hěn duō, wǒ de tóngxué Guó'ān yě gǎnmào le, jīntiān kāishǐ fāshāo le.","english":"Many people got colds lately. My classmate, Guoan, got a cold, too. He started to have a fever today.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個學期開始，從星期一到星期五我都有華語課，每天從上午八點四十分到中午十二點上課，下午一點寫功課，有時候也跟同學練習說中文。","pinyin":"Zhè ge xuéqí kāishǐ, cóng xīngqí yī dào xīngqí wǔ, wǒ dōu yǒu Huáyǔ kè, měi tiān cóng shàngwǔ bā diǎn sìshí fēn dào zhōngwǔ shí’èr diǎn shàngkè, xiàwǔ yī diǎn xiě gōngkè, yǒushíhou yě gēn tóngxué liànxí shuō Zhōngwén.","english":"This semester I have Chinese class from 8:40 a.m. to 12:00 noon, Mondays to Fridays. I start to do my homework at 1:00 p.m., and sometimes I practice speaking Chinese with my classmates.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"很多年輕男生愛在書店看汽車雜誌，汽車很貴，他們不一定可以買新車，可是都看得很開心。","pinyin":"Hěn duō niánqīng nánshēng ài zài shūdiàn kàn qìchē zázhì, qìchē hěn guì, tāmen bù yídìng kěyǐ mǎi xīn chē, kěshì dōu kàn de hěn kāixīn.","english":"Many young men like to read car magazines at bookstores. Cars are expensive and they don’t usually have the money to buy new ones; however, they are very happy just by reading those magazines.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"從我家到機場也不遠，開車去、坐捷運去都可以。","pinyin":"Cóng wǒ jiā dào jīchǎng yě bù yuǎn, kāichē qù, zuò jiéyùn qù dōu kěyǐ.","english":"It is not far from my house to the airport. I can go by car or MRT.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"The 門(door)'s 开(bolt) slides free → 開(open)."},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-08\",\"剛好\",\"剛好\",\"刚好\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"冷氣的溫度要是控制得剛好，不但對健康好，也能省點兒電費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-08","source