ourceCardId":"B3L06-1-41","sourceFront":"招待","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:這個玩具雖然可愛，但是不適合送給剛滿月的孩子，我們還是送紅包吧！ B:也好。送紅包也不錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-43","sourceFront":"也好","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"照華人的傳統習慣，女人生完孩子就要坐月子，一直在家休息到孩子滿月。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-01","sourceFront":"坐月子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"朋友的孩子滿月了，我想送他一份禮，祝福他平平安安地長大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-21","sourceFront":"禮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"張太太上個月生了一個女兒，我寫了一張卡片祝福她，希望孩子快快樂樂地長大。 我的孩子滿月時，收到很多朋友送的禮物和滿滿的祝福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-11","sourceFront":"祝福","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在臺灣，孩子出生滿一個月的時候，有的父母會請客，慶祝孩子滿月。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-01","sourceFront":"滿月","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"錢老闆滿腦子都是工作，每天只想著怎麼讓公司成長得快一點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-26","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小簡向很多公司自我推薦，經過了幾個月，最後找到了滿意的工作","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-14","sourceFront":"經過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我住的房子不大，也沒有很多錢，可是家人都很愛我， 讓我覺得很幸福、很滿足。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-17","sourceFront":"滿足","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在你的國家，成年的孩子常跟父母住在一起，還是滿十八歲就搬出去了？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-11","sourceFront":"成年","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我有一個幸福美滿的家庭，父母都很愛我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-24","sourceFront":"家庭","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老闆很滿意小陳的工作表現， 明年要請他當經理呢！","pinyin":"","engli